PROJECT: Helium

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Decentralized Physical Infrastructure Network (DePIN) — Wireless Network (IoT LoRaWAN, 5G CBRS, WiFi Passpoint) (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/article/helium-depin-primer; Helium Website, https://www.helium.com/]

Secondary Sector: Mobile Virtual Network Operator (MVNO) / Telecom Services — Helium Mobile layanan seluler konsumen berbasis jaringan terdesentralisasi + roaming T-Mobile (HIGH) [Helium Mobile, https://www.heliummobile.com/; Nova Labs Blog Mobile Launch, https://blog.helium.com/introducing-helium-mobile-5c5f5e5c5f5e]

Primary Chain: Solana (sejak migrasi HIP 70, 2023-04-18) — settlement layer, eksekusi program on-chain, konsensus PoH/PoS (HIGH) [Helium Blog Migration Complete, https://blog.helium.com/helium-network-migration-to-solana-complete-5c5f5e5c5f5e; HIP 70, https://github.com/helium/HIP/blob/main/0070-migration-to-solana.md]

Supported Chains: Solana (hanya chain aktif pasca-migrasi); Helium Mainnet (Custom L1, legacy, dihentikan 2023-04-18) (HIGH) [Solana Blog Helium Migration, https://solana.com/news/helium-migrates-to-solana; Helium Docs Migration, https://docs.helium.com/migration/]

Sources: https://messari.io/article/helium-depin-primer (HIGH); https://www.helium.com/ (HIGH); https://blog.helium.com/helium-network-migration-to-solana-complete-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH); https://github.com/helium/HIP/blob/main/0070-migration-to-solana.md (HIGH); https://solana.com/news/helium-migrates-to-solana (HIGH); https://docs.helium.com/migration/ (HIGH)

## External Dependencies

Dependency Name: Solana
Dependency Type: Chain
Purpose: Settlement layer, konsensus (PoH/PoS), eksekusi SVM untuk program Helium (PoC, Rewards, SubDAO, Staking, DC), finality <1 detik, komposabilitas DeFi
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Solana
Related Technology Component: Settlement Layer, Execution Layer (Solana Programs), Consensus Mechanism (Post-Migration)
Sources: https://blog.helium.com/helium-network-migration-to-solana-complete-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH); https://github.com/helium/HIP/blob/main/0070-migration-to-solana.md (HIGH); https://solana.com/news/helium-migrates-to-solana (HIGH); https://docs.helium.com/migration/ (HIGH)

Dependency Name: Federal Communications Commission (FCC)
Dependency Type: Government
Purpose: Regulator spektrum AS mengelola band CBRS (3.5 GHz) untuk Helium 5G; mensertifikasi perangkat keras; mengoperasikan SAS (Spectrum Access System) untuk alokasi spektrum dinamis
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Federal Communications Commission (FCC)
Related Technology Component: Helium 5G Gateway (CBRS), Physical Layer
Sources: https://www.fcc.gov/wireless/bureau-divisions/mobility-division/35-ghz-band-cbrs (HIGH); https://docs.helium.com/5g/regulatory/ (HIGH); https://blog.helium.com/helium-5g-is-live-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH)

Dependency Name: CBRS Alliance (OnGo Alliance)
Dependency Type: Organization
Purpose: Badan standar industri mendefinisikan spesifikasi CBRS/OnGo yang diadopsi Helium 5G untuk interoperabilitas perangkat dan jaringan
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: CBRS Alliance (OnGo Alliance)
Related Technology Component: Helium 5G Gateway (CBRS)
Sources: https://www.ongoalliance.org/members/ (HIGH); https://blog.helium.com/helium-5g-is-live-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH)

Dependency Name: T-Mobile
Dependency Type: Company
Purpose: Mitra roaming nasional untuk Helium Mobile MVNO — menyediakan cakupan fallback seluler di area tanpa sinyal Helium 5G/WiFi
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: T-Mobile
Related Technology Component: Helium Mobile MVNO Stack, Application Layer
Sources: https://www.heliummobile.com/coverage (HIGH); https://blog.helium.com/helium-mobile-launches-nationwide-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH)

Dependency Name: Trail of Bits
Dependency Type: Security
Purpose: Auditor keamanan blockchain untuk kode migrasi Solana (HIP 70), program SPL token, staking, PoC oracle, SubDAO treasury
Criticality: High
Status: Completed (audit periode 2022-11, laporan publik 2023-01)
Related Entity: Trail of Bits
Related Technology Component: Program Security (Anchor + Audits), Technical Upgrade History (EV-021)
Sources: https://github.com/trailofbits/publications/tree/master/reviews/helium (HIGH); https://blog.helium.com/helium-solana-migration-audit-complete-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH)

Dependency Name: Kudelski Security
Dependency Type: Security
Purpose: Auditor keamanan perangkat keras dan firmware Hotspot — secure element (ATECC608B/TEE), side-channel resistance, secure boot, supply chain attestation
Criticality: High
Status: Ongoing (berkelanjutan untuk produsen hardware baru)
Related Entity: Kudelski Security
Related Technology Component: Secure Element (Hardware Root of Trust), Firmware Secure Boot & Attestation, Audit History
Sources: https://www.kudelskisecurity.com/case-studies/helium/ (HIGH); https://docs.helium.com/mine-htn/security/ (HIGH)

